// Cat 8: scale(...) inside a recipe body (ingredient RHS) — must fail per spec §9
// spec: "All three operations are call-site only. They cannot appear inside a recipe body."
// Bug candidate: parser may ACCEPT this.
recipe base() serves 4 {
    ingredient flour : 200 g
    step "mix" { combine(flour) }
}
recipe wrapper() serves 4 {
    ingredient flour : scale(base(), by: 2)
    step "x" { combine(flour) }
}
evaluate wrapper()
